    <statement><p>For each of the indefinite integrals below, the main question is to decide whether 
the integral can be evaluated using a basic antiderivative, <m>u</m>-substitution, integration by parts, a 
combination of <m>u</m>-substitution and integration by parts, or none of these other techniques.</p>
<p>For integrals for which your answer is affirmative (<m>u</m>-sub, by parts, combo), you should be able to state
what <m>u</m> and <m>du</m> are, or what <m>u</m> and <m>dv</m> are.</p>
